msgstr "Hööftreekner för LDAP-Anfragen:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, customLDAPProxy)
#. +> trunk stable
#: ui/smimeconfiguration.ui:251
msgid ""
"Entering a LDAP server here will make all LDAP requests go to that server first. More precisely, this setting overrides any specified host and port part in a LDAP URL and will also be used if host and port have been omitted from the URL. Other LDAP servers will be used only if the connection to the \"proxy\" failed.\n"
"The syntax is \"HOST\" or \"HOST:PORT\". If PORT is omitted, port 389 (standard LDAP port) is used."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du hier en LDAP-Server angiffst, gaht all LDAP-Anfragen toeerst na dissen Server. Technisch warrt disse Reekner ansteed all angeven oder ok nich angeven Reekner- un Portdelen vun en LDAP-URL bruukt. Anner LDAP-Servers warrt bloots bruukt, wenn dat Tokoppeln na den \"Proxy\" fehlsleit.\n"
"De Schriefwies is \"Reekner\" oder \"Reekner:Port\". Is keen Port angeven, warrt Port 389 (Standardport för LDAP) bruukt."

